  "brief": {
    "zh": "每套应急包需要 2 个电池、3 个固定夹和 1 个密封圈。仓库有 15 个电池、16 个固定夹、7 个密封圈，至少留 3 个电池、2 个固定夹在货架。发货箱只能装 25 件，其中必须有且只有 1 张调度卡。装尽可能多的完整套装，余料和扳手留在货架。让 AI 交出整箱清单，每轮指出所有不合规则的项目。",
    "en": "Each emergency kit needs 2 batteries, 3 clamps, and 1 seal. The shelf holds 15 batteries, 16 clamps, and 7 seals. Keep at least 3 batteries and 2 clamps on the shelf. The box fits 25 pieces, including exactly 1 dispatch card. Pack as many complete kits as possible. Leave loose spares and the wrench on the shelf. Have AI submit the full manifest and flag every discrepancy each round."
  },
